ADDITIONAL NOTICE — FLASHING RISK / 额外声明 — 刷机风险

This project modifies firmware packages and instructs the user to flash a
device via Qualcomm EDL. Flashing carries a real risk of rendering a device
unbootable ("hard brick"). On some OPPO/OnePlus models, official system
updates permanently blow the EDL no-auth fuse, which is irreversible.

本项目会修改固件包并指导用户通过高通 EDL 刷写设备。刷机存在真实的
"硬砖"风险。部分 OPPO/一加 机型的官方系统更新会永久熔断 EDL 免授权，
不可逆。

USE AT YOUR OWN RISK. The authors accept no liability for damaged or
bricked devices.

使用风险自负。作者不对设备损坏或变砖承担任何责任。

